<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Wpath (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>wpath &lt;someone or something&gt;
wpath &lt;unit@zone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>wpath Gnort
</pre>
<p>Finds the way to someone or something: anyone or anything in the world 
by name, or a unit by its symbolic name. You are told its symbolic name, 
the room it is in (click it to goto there), and the first direction to 
walk from where you stand to get there along the shortest path.
</p><p>It replaces the old path command. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Goto</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Track</a>
</pre>




</div>